MSFT,Microsoft,Technology,2019,ok,"Empowering others
Our mission is to empower every person and organization on the planet to achieve more.
Our company
Stay informed about Microsoft – from company facts and news to our worldwide locations and more.
Who we are
Get to know some of our people, explore engaging stories, and meet the leaders who shape our vision.
What we value
See how we utilize technology to build platforms and resources to help make a lasting positive impact.
Featured programs and projects
Microsoft By the Numbers
Adding up the stories that make Microsoft, By the Numbers is an interactive look at what drives us, from quantum computing to environmental sustainability.
Microsoft Philanthropies
We believe technology is a powerful tool for social and economic inclusion, and we’re working to ensure that everyone has access to the opportunities it creates.
Story Labs
At Microsoft, we’re moved and inspired by many things. Microsoft Story Labs features in-depth interviews, features, and stories with those that are on the forefront of innovation.
Microsoft AI
When designed with people at the center, AI can extend your capabilities, free you up for more creative and strategic endeavors, and help you or your organization achieve more.",substantive_change,innovation;purpose_mission,minor,"Weâre moved and inspired by many things. Microsoft Story Labs features in-depth interviews, features, and stories with those that are on the forefront of innovation.",not_usable,0.6051,substantive,False,diversity_inclusion;environment_sustainability;innovation;purpose_mission,Text similarity to prior year = 0.6051,values_or_mission,Dictionary (keyword) coded against theme_codebook.json; evidence is a cue snippet. | LLM: Ensure the new mission statement aligns with the company's previous values and purpose.,microsoft.com/en-us/about,20190702051350,https://web.archive.org/web/20190702051350id_/https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/about,1222,0,0,1,0,0,1,0,2,0,0,0,2,coded,qwen2.5:3b,2,0,0,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,3
