accessible and useful.
Ten things we know to be true
#1: Focus on the user and all else will follow.
Since the beginning, weâve focused on providing the best user experience possible. Whether weâre designing a new Internet browser or a new tweak to the look of the homepage, we take great care to ensure that they will ultimately serve you, rather than our own internal goal or bottom line.
News from Google
Read up on our latest news, browse our blog directory, or choose to follow a number of Google+ pages for updates on various products and initiatives.
Google careers
