CRM,Salesforce,Technology,2022,ok,"Bringing people together changes everything.
In unity, there is power.
When we come together, we unlock hidden potential. We unify people to help businesses and communities pursue their loftiest goals, solve their thorniest challenges, and harness their success to leave our planet a little better than we found it.
The world will continue to change. Technology will evolve. Business will pivot and pivot again. But relationships, built on trust and respect, will help us face the future, come what may.
Bret Taylor, Salesforce President & COO
We build bridges between companies and customers.
Every product we offer plays a part in building the connections that drive success â and that success can be harnessed to create positive change.
HISTORY
A jump to the cloud.
A leap of trust.
The cloud was born.
Cultivating trust.
âWith Salesforce as our partner, we trust them to take us on a journey to success. We can create extraordinary experiences for our customers and that will move us forward.â
Dr. Astrid Fontaine, Board Member for People, Digitalization and IT, Bentley Motors
OUR CORE VALUES
What brings us together guides us forward.
Trust
We act as trusted advisors.
Customer Success
When our customers succeed, we succeed.
Innovation
We innovate together.
Equality
Everyone deserves equal opportunities.
VALUES IN ACTION
We believe business is the greatest platform for change.
We are passionate proponents of stakeholder capitalism, committed to doing well by all our stakeholders â our customers, employees, partners, communities, the planet, and society as a whole.
And we lead by example, spearheading initiatives in philanthropy, racial equality and justice, climate action and advocacy, and the ethical and humane use of technology.
A win-win-win approach.
CULTURE
We are Trailblazers.
We are family.
Helping customers succeed. Itâs a Salesforce thing.
Questions? Weâll put you on the right path.
Ask about Salesforce products, pricing, implementation, or anything else. Our highly trained reps are standing by, ready to help.
Or call 1-800-667-6389",substantive_change,customer;innovation;respect_people;environment_sustainability;purpose_mission,minor,"We are passionate proponents of stakeholder capitalism, committed to doing well by all our stakeholders â our customers, employees, partners, communities, the planet, and society as a whole.",not_usable,0.1711,substantive,True,community_social_impact;customer;environment_sustainability;innovation;integrity;performance_execution;respect_people,Text similarity to prior year = 0.1711,general_about,Dictionary (keyword) coded against theme_codebook.json; evidence is a cue snippet. | LLM: The analyst should verify the specific initiatives and programs Salesforce has implemented to support stakeholder capitalism.,salesforce.com/company/our-story/,20220104021447,https://web.archive.org/web/20220104021447id_/https://www.salesforce.com/company/our-story/,2064,3,3,1,0,2,0,2,1,1,0,0,0,coded,qwen2.5:3b,0,0,3,3,0,3,0,0,2,0,0,0,3
