UNH,UnitedHealth Group,Healthcare,2018,ok,"UnitedHealth Group is a distinctively diversified health and well-being company headquartered in the United States, and a leader worldwide in helping people live healthier lives and helping make the health system work better for everyone.
We are committed to introducing innovative approaches, products and services that can improve personal health and promote healthier populations in local communities. Our core capabilities in clinical expertise, advanced technology and data and health information uniquely enable us to meet the evolving needs of a changing health care environment.
UnitedHealth Group serves clients and consumers through two distinct platforms:
UnitedHealthcare provides health care coverage and benefits services.
Optum provides information and technology-enabled health services.
Clinical Insight
Knowledge and experience in organizing health care resources to best serve specific local market needs.
Technology
Enabling a variety of interactions at enormous scale and complexity, helping connect all participants in health care.
Data & Information
Unique skills in collecting, managing and analyzing data; and the capability to translate data into actionable information.
130
Through UnitedHealthcare and Optum, UnitedHealth Group offers health benefits and services to people residing in all 50 states in the United States and more than 130 other countries.
~$3.3B
UnitedHealth Group invests more than $3.3 billion in technology and innovation, and processes approximately 1 trillion transactions annually.
285K
More than 285,000 people worldwide power UnitedHealth Group with their entrepreneurial spirit and commitment to quality, including at least 85,000 clinical professionals focused on helping people live healthier lives.",no_prior_snapshot,customer;innovation;respect_people,no_prior,"The focus on innovation and investment in technology has increased, while the emphasis on UnitedHealth Group's role in the health care environment remains consistent.",not_usable,,no_prior,,customer;environment_sustainability;innovation;performance_execution;respect_people,,general_about,Dictionary (keyword) coded against theme_codebook.json; evidence is a cue snippet. | LLM: The specific investments in technology and innovation should be cross-referenced with recent financial reports for accuracy.,unitedhealthgroup.com/about.html,20181101211321,https://web.archive.org/web/20181101211321id_/https://www.unitedhealthgroup.com/about.html,1755,0,1,2,0,1,0,1,1,0,0,0,0,coded,qwen2.5:3b,0,0,3,3,0,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0
