ABBV,AbbVie,Healthcare,2021,ok,"We are AbbVie
Our ~48,000 employees are scientists, researchers, communicators, manufacturing specialists and regulatory experts located around the globe. We come up with new approaches to addressing today’s health issues—from life-threatening illness to chronic conditions.
We target specific difficult-to-cure diseases where we can leverage our core R&D expertise to advance science. We’re constantly working to create solutions that go beyond treating the illness to have a positive impact on patients’ lives, on societies—and on science itself.
At AbbVie, we see a future full of possibility, where health is in reach and patient lives are improved. See our employees, our science and our hope for tomorrow:",substantive_change,innovation;performance_execution;environment_sustainability,none,"We see a future full of possibility, where health is in reach and patient lives are improved.",not_usable,0.3012,substantive,False,customer;innovation;respect_people,Text similarity to prior year = 0.3012,general_about,"Dictionary (keyword) coded against theme_codebook.json; evidence is a cue snippet. | LLM: No significant changes in values messaging, but the tone has shifted towards a more aspirational future.",abbvie.com/our-company.html,20210724072941,https://web.archive.org/web/20210724072941id_/https://www.abbvie.com/our-company.html,711,0,2,2,0,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,coded,qwen2.5:3b,0,0,0,3,0,0,0,3,1,0,0,0,0
ABBV,AbbVie,Healthcare,2022,ok,"It takes unwavering commitment and confidence to bring solutions from the petri dish to patients. And it requires a continued investment in innovation to address the known and unknown challenges of tomorrow.
Since our launch in 2013, we have invested ~$50 billion in research to discover, develop and deliver new medicines. We target diseases with significant unmet need where we can improve the standard of care with innovative new therapies. We’re constantly working to create solutions that go beyond treating the illness to have a positive impact on patients’ lives, on societies—and on science itself.
Today, our ~50,000 employees around the world focus on discovering and delivering transformational medicines and products in several key therapeutic areas: immunology, oncology, neuroscience, eye care, virology, and women’s health, as well as through our Allergan Aesthetics portfolio.
We care deeply for patients and customers, their families, our employees, and our communities. We strive to always do the right thing, pursuing the highest standards in quality, compliance, safety, and performance. We embrace diverse backgrounds and perspectives and treat everyone equally, with dignity and respect, allowing us all to achieve our best.
Our commitment to health doesn’t stop with our medicines. Each day, we work to deliver sustainable solutions that improve the health of our business and the health of humankind.",substantive_change,customer;innovation;respect_people;performance_execution;environment_sustainability;community_social_impact;purpose_mission,none,"We care deeply for patients and customers, their families, our employees, and our communities. We strive to always do the right thing, pursuing the highest standards in quality, compliance, safety, and performance.",not_usable,0.3766,substantive,False,customer;environment_sustainability;innovation;integrity;performance_execution;respect_people;safety,Text similarity to prior year = 0.3766,general_about,Dictionary (keyword) coded against theme_codebook.json; evidence is a cue snippet. | LLM: The tone of the page has shifted to emphasize the company's commitment to its stakeholders and the importance of ethical conduct.,abbvie.com/our-company.html,20220702055118,https://web.archive.org/web/20220702055118id_/https://www.abbvie.com/our-company.html,1424,1,3,3,0,3,0,2,1,0,1,0,0,coded,qwen2.5:3b,0,0,3,3,0,3,0,3,2,3,0,0,3
ABBV,AbbVie,Healthcare,2023,ok,"But it’s more than what we discover—it’s how we get there.
who we are
Meeting the needs of our times
AbbVie’s mission is to discover and deliver innovative medicines and solutions that address complex health issues and enhance people's lives.
Every solution starts with the patient’s perspective, because transformative medicines only matter when they are safe, effective and accessible to everyone who needs them.
We are making significant advancements with a robust pipeline of potential new medicines as we look to find the treatments of tomorrow.
We are driven by our compassion for people, commitment to innovation and inclusion, service to the community and uncompromising integrity.
our leaders
Our mission to improve lives starts at the top
Our leaders’ vision and expertise guide our teams, while their commitment to patients fuels our culture.
