PSX,Phillips 66,Energy,2023,redirect_followed,"Guided by our core values of safety, honor and commitment, we work to meet the world’s energy needs today and tomorrow.
Business Operations
With a focus on continually improving our operations, we provide enduring value to our employees, investors and communities.
Innovation & Operational Performance
Making continual advancements is critical to supporting our existing operations and developing technologies for future needs.
We invest in technology to become more efficient and position ourselves to capitalize on emerging opportunities as the energy market transforms, including a commitment to alternative energy.
A focus on safety and operational excellence helps ensure that we remain a strong, vibrant company.
We continue to explore and develop a variety of renewable fuels and resources.
Renewable Fuels
Batteries
Carbon Capture
Hydrogen
Bringing innovations to market is how we succeed and help move the world forward.
Community
We are committed to safe operations within our facilities and the communities where we live and work.
Safety
We are determined to remain the industry’s safest and most reliable company and consistently achieve and maintain top safety and environmental performance.
Social Impact
Our corporate giving and employee volunteerism programs promote economic, social and environmental efforts in the communities in which we live and work, with more than $250 million contributed since 2012.",substantive_change,innovation;community_social_impact;safety,none,"The tone has shifted to emphasize the company's commitment to safety, innovation, and community impact, while maintaining the core values of safety, honor, and commitment.",not_usable,0.1159,substantive,False,community_social_impact;environment_sustainability;innovation;performance_execution;respect_people;safety,Text similarity to prior year = 0.1159,general_about,Dictionary (keyword) coded against theme_codebook.json; evidence is a cue snippet. | LLM: The analyst should verify the specific contributions and impact of the corporate giving and volunteerism programs.,phillips66.com/about,20230711173349,https://web.archive.org/web/20230711173349/https://phillips66.com/about,1423,0,0,2,0,2,0,3,3,1,3,0,0,coded,qwen2.5:3b,0,0,0,3,0,0,0,0,0,3,3,0,0
