VLO,Valero Energy,Energy,2024,ok,"Valero | Who We Are
- Fortune 500 Company
- Headquartered in San Antonio, Texas
- ~10,000 Employees
- World’s Largest Independent Refiner
- 15 refineries in the U.S., Canada and the U.K. with 3.2 million barrels per day (bpd) of high-complexity throughput capacity
- Industry safety leader with 9 OSHA VPP sites, the most of any refiner
- One of the world’s largest low-carbon fuels producers
- World’s 2nd largest corn ethanol producer
- World’s 2nd largest renewable diesel producer
- Developing large-scale Sustainable Aviation Fuel (SAF) project, expected fourth quarter 2024
- Achieved 2025 GHG emissions target by reducing and displacing more than 63% of global refinery Scope 1 and Scope 2 emissions in 2022, three years early. On track to achieve 100% global refinery Scope 1 and Scope 2 GHG emissions reduction/displacement target by 2035.
- 2023 was our best year ever for mechanical availability
- 33 wind turbines in the U.S.
- Over $77 million generated for charities in 2023
